==Battleground==
*5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~8.33 seconds<sup>200f~250f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*8 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Saber (Enemy)|Saber]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.
**5 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**8 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

